  "notes": [
    "Concept: same as A (データベースがプレイリストに) but told as benefits for the viewer: use-case hook (text, 3.4 s) → three benefit beats with a short real clip each → end card with icon, name, value, price and conditions.",
    "Real app footage only appears inside the rounded cards (7 clips, about 15 s in total) from the same TestFlight 1.0.0 (8) take as A; no synthetic UI, no device frame.",
    "Use cases in the hook (ボイスメモ・語学の音声・会議の録音・講義の動画) are examples of the viewer's own files in Notion; the app ships no content. The end card says 再生する音声・動画は、ご自身でご用意ください.",
    "Feature chips (倍速・スリープタイマー・バックグラウンド再生) are shipped in 1.0.0 (8): PlayerViews.swift rate menu / sleep timer, Info.plist UIBackgroundModes audio, listed in the App Store description.",
    "Price: 500円・買い切り only (user decision 2026-10-25). No IAP, subscription, update promise, AI, time-stamped notes or auto-save claims.",
    "Music: playback-original-chord-sketch-30s.m4a (project-original, synthesised with FFmpeg aevalsrc; candidate8/app-preview/media/RIGHTS.md), the same file that plays in the demo library.",
    "NASA credit is shown small under the video clip only; NASA is not named elsewhere.",
    "Hook: the first line is fully visible from frame 0 (start -0.4 s, no rise) so the video never opens on an empty background; music starts at 0 s with a 0.3 s fade-in.",
